	<summary type="text">A young woman meets again with a lover whose marriage proposal she had been persuaded to reject several years ago.</summary>
	<content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Anne Elliot is the under-valued daughter of a vain and improvident English baronet, Sir Walter Elliot. Some years previously, at the urging of a family friend, Anne had rejected a marriage proposal from a young but impoverished naval captain. When she unexpectedly encounters him again, she is filled with regrets.&lt;/p&gt;
			&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;Persuasion&lt;/i&gt; was published in 1817, six months after &lt;a href=&quot;https://standardebooks.org/ebooks/jane-austen&quot;&gt;Jane Austen’s&lt;/a&gt; death, and is the last novel she completed in full. It was well-regarded on publication and has been turned into several television series and movies.&lt;/p&gt;</content>
